```bash
gosvc validate --project .
gosvc check architecture --project .
gosvc doctor --project .
gosvc verify --project . --static
```

Use `gosvc verify --project .` without `--static` to also execute tests,
race detection, vet, build, lint, and vulnerability analysis.

## Upgrade generator metadata and templates

Preview changes before upgrading:

```bash
gosvc upgrade --project . --dry-run
```

Apply the upgrade only after reviewing protected files and generated changes:

```bash
gosvc upgrade --project .
```

The operation is atomic and records its history in `.gosvc/manifest.json`.
External plugin manifests can be inspected without executing plugin code:

```bash
gosvc plugins list --project .
gosvc plugins validate --project .
```

